# The handwriting model's weights never go in git (ValeCodebase is public): they were
# trained on IAM-OnDB, an evaluation asset. Rebuild them on a new machine with
# Vale__ValeVision__AuraRender/60__Dev__WebBuildUtils/AuraRender__BuildUtil__HandwritingWeights__.py
# The manifest beside them (layout, SHA-256, no weights) is committed.
*.bin
*.tmp
